---
layout: base.njk
title: "QA Blog | Software Testing Insights | goGreenlit"
description: "QA engineering insights from the goGreenlit team. Test automation, manual testing, API testing, agile QA, and startup quality strategy – written by engineers, not marketers."
---

<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <p class="section-label">goGreenlit Blog</p>
    <h1>QA Insights Written by Engineers</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-sub">No fluff. No "top 10 testing tips." Just honest writing about what works, what doesn't, and how we think about quality in real software teams.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section>
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="blog-grid">
      {% for post in collections.blogPosts %}
      {% set postSlug = post.url.split('/')[2] %}
      <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="blog-card">
        <div class="blog-card-icon">
          {% if blogIcons[postSlug] %}
            {{ blogIcons[postSlug] | safe }}
          {% else %}
            <svg class="post-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect width="48" height="48" rx="10" fill="#E1F5EE"/>
              <rect x="11" y="12" width="26" height="28" rx="3" fill="white" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="2"/>
              <line x1="16" y1="21" x2="32" y2="21" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <line x1="16" y1="27" x2="32" y2="27" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <line x1="16" y1="33" x2="26" y2="33" stroke="#9FE1CB" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="blog-card-body">
          <div class="blog-card-meta">{{ post.data.author }} &middot; {{ post.data.date | dateToISO }}</div>
          <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
          <p class="blog-card-excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="cta-band">
  <h2>Want insights like these for your team?</h2>
  <p>We write about what we actually do – the QA practices that work for startups and growing engineering teams. If you want this embedded in your sprint cycle, let's talk.</p>
  <a href="{{ site.calendly }}" class="btn btn-white btn-lg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a Free 30-Min Call</a>
</div>
